Subject: [PATCH 4/4] build: Link v1.0.6 by tag

The pin moves from rev ce140ae to the v1.0.6 tag (cd380d6: the harness's
portal stand-in registers shortcuts with Hyprland). Re-resolving under the
1.88 MSRV fallback also settles windows-sys and getrandom on versions every
dependent accepts. License inventory and notices regenerated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015owd4wcAhMR1xnKP9qs3Tf
